From fe8e3259eef10b9ce82480f1d5fc2fe260c9d091 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek Kekane <akekane@redhat.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 07:07:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Pin import downloads to validated destination addresses

Re-validate import URIs at fetch time, resolve DNS when the download
starts, and pin HTTP connections to the validated destination address.
This closes the DNS rebinding window between API validation and async
worker download.

Closes-Bug: #2158999
SecurityImpact

Assisted-By: Cursor (claude-4.5-sonnet)
Change-Id: Ie4fbbf28262e4c5650b40798dde6007748cc9760
Signed-off-by: Abhishek Kekane <akekane@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit df123cffa318b484fa6d55729858e48afa17aa57)

